00:01:34.420 --> 00:01:36.480
Suddenly, we started to see things like, and mind you

00:01:36.480 --> 00:01:41.340
this is an actual video on Youtube, that was actually edited together by someone.

00:01:41.340 --> 00:01:44.100
The Bee Movie trailer, but every time they say "bee,"

00:01:44.100 --> 00:01:46.880
it's We Are Number One, but every time it says "One,"

00:01:46.880 --> 00:01:49.260
it's the Legend27 commercial, but for every

00:01:49.260 --> 00:01:52.680
third TheLegend27 commercial, its bass is boosted

00:01:52.680 --> 00:01:55.380
beyond comprehension, but the second to last "one"

00:01:55.380 --> 00:01:58.280
in every We Are Number One is replaced by Brendaniel

00:01:58.280 --> 00:02:01.200
reading the entire Bee Movie script. Also, the fourth

00:02:01.200 --> 00:02:03.160
